WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:02.701
-Welcome to "The Tonight Show,"
everybody!

00:00:02.701 --> 00:00:04.033
That's a crowd right there.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:04.033 --> 00:00:07.000
Welcome.
Thank you for watching.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.601
Well, let's get
to some news, guys.

00:00:08.601 --> 00:00:10.601
This is big.
Apparently President Biden

00:00:10.601 --> 00:00:13.868
is seriously considering
canceling student-loan debt.

00:00:13.868 --> 00:00:18.834
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:18.834 --> 00:00:21.300
When asked how the country
can afford it, Biden said,

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:23.734
"I'm gonna slide into
Elon Musk's DMs."

00:00:23.734 --> 00:00:27.734
[ Laughter ]

00:00:27.734 --> 00:00:29.868
Yep, Biden wasn't
even thinking about forgiving

00:00:29.868 --> 00:00:31.934
student-loan debt until
he looked at his poll numbers

00:00:31.934 --> 00:00:33.133
with young voters.

00:00:33.133 --> 00:00:35.801
"And your debt will be forgiven.
Perfect."

00:00:35.801 --> 00:00:37.167
[ Laughter ]

00:00:37.167 --> 00:00:38.934
Yeah, Biden's basically
telling every college student,

00:00:38.934 --> 00:00:40.434
"I'll take care of
your four years

00:00:40.434 --> 00:00:41.667
if you take care of mine,
you know?"

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:44.133
[ Laughter ]

00:00:44.133 --> 00:00:47.133
It's a risky move for Biden.
He's about to win over everyone

00:00:47.133 --> 00:00:50.334
with student loans, and lose
everyone who just paid them off.

00:00:50.334 --> 00:00:51.467
Like, "You gotta be kidding me!"

00:00:51.467 --> 00:00:52.734
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.734 --> 00:00:53.934
Meanwhile,
today at the White House,

00:00:53.934 --> 00:00:57.634
Biden hosted the 2022
Teachers of the Year.

00:00:57.634 --> 00:01:00.200
Yeah. Biden honored the
Teachers of the Year,

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:01.501
while over in the next room,

00:01:01.501 --> 00:01:02.868
they honored the
Substitute of the Year

00:01:02.868 --> 00:01:04.067
by putting on a movie.

00:01:04.067 --> 00:01:08.934
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:08.934 --> 00:01:10.934
"Hold on."

00:01:10.934 --> 00:01:14.901
[ Applause continues ]

00:01:14.901 --> 00:01:17.567
At the ceremony, Biden awarded
the national Teacher of the Year

00:01:17.567 --> 00:01:19.400
a glass apple.

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:21.868
The teacher was like, "That's
cool, but how about a raise?"

00:01:21.868 --> 00:01:23.634
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.634 --> 00:01:25.567
It was a great event
for the teachers,

00:01:25.567 --> 00:01:27.501
but it was super-awkward after
when Biden

00:01:27.501 --> 00:01:29.200
ran into them
at the grocery store.

00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:31.267
[ Laughter ]
"Ah!

00:01:31.267 --> 00:01:35.200
Can't see you outside of --
You have a husband?"

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:37.234
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.234 --> 00:01:39.601
Some business news --
I read that if Elon Musk

00:01:39.601 --> 00:01:41.234
backs out of the Twitter deal,

00:01:41.234 --> 00:01:44.701
he'll have to pay
a $1 billion termination fee.

00:01:44.701 --> 00:01:46.067
[ Audience "Oohs" ]
Yeah.

00:01:46.067 --> 00:01:47.901
A billion-dollar
termination fee --

00:01:47.901 --> 00:01:50.667
it's pretty much the same deal
as leaving Planet Fitness.

00:01:50.667 --> 00:01:54.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.133 --> 00:01:57.868
Some entertainment news --
Today at CinemaCon in Las Vegas,

00:01:57.868 --> 00:02:00.934
13 years after the original
"Avatar" hit theaters,

00:02:00.934 --> 00:02:04.033
viewers were treated to a first
look at James Cameron's sequel

00:02:04.033 --> 00:02:07.067
"Avatar: The Way of Water."

00:02:07.067 --> 00:02:08.801
Yeah, 13 years.

00:02:08.801 --> 00:02:11.334
That's a long time.
Now the characters are so old,

00:02:11.334 --> 00:02:13.634
they have "the way of water"
three times a night.

00:02:13.634 --> 00:02:19.434
[ Laughter ]

00:02:19.434 --> 00:02:20.868
Yeah, the characters are so old,

00:02:20.868 --> 00:02:22.801
they're now blue
because of poor circulation.

00:02:22.801 --> 00:02:24.434
That's -- That's what I mean.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.434 --> 00:02:25.968
Speaking of big movies,
it was just announced

00:02:25.968 --> 00:02:28.501
that Robert Pattinson's gonna
return for a sequel

00:02:28.501 --> 00:02:31.334
of "The Batman."
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:31.334 --> 00:02:34.834
Yes!

00:02:34.834 --> 00:02:36.601
That's right.
Eccentric billionaire

00:02:36.601 --> 00:02:38.968
who tries to solve the world's
problems by himself.

00:02:38.968 --> 00:02:40.934
Spoiler alert --
he just buys Twitter.

00:02:40.934 --> 00:02:42.501
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.501 --> 00:02:43.868
Hey, this is pretty cool.

00:02:43.868 --> 00:02:46.667
Scientists have created
genetically modified lettuce,

00:02:46.667 --> 00:02:48.701
that can keep astronaut's bones
from crumbling

00:02:48.701 --> 00:02:51.434
on their trip to Mars.
Yeah.

00:02:51.434 --> 00:02:52.767
When asked their opinion on it,

00:02:52.767 --> 00:02:54.701
here's what several astronauts
had to say.

00:02:54.701 --> 00:02:55.734
This first astronaut said...

00:02:58.901 --> 00:03:03.901
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.901 --> 00:03:05.234
This next astronaut said...

00:03:09.334 --> 00:03:11.267
[ Laughter ]

00:03:11.267 --> 00:03:12.767
Next astronaut said...

00:03:14.701 --> 00:03:16.701
[ Laughter ]

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:22.434
[ Laughter ]

00:03:22.434 --> 00:03:24.100
And finally,
this last astronaut said...

00:03:27.634 --> 00:03:29.734
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:29.734 --> 00:03:32.067
[ Cymbal crashes ]

00:03:35.267 --> 00:03:36.701
This is kind of a weird story.

00:03:36.701 --> 00:03:38.934
In Alabama,
after raw chicken parts

00:03:38.934 --> 00:03:40.501
were spilled all over the road,

00:03:40.501 --> 00:03:44.267
police told people to drive
carefully and hold their nose.

00:03:44.267 --> 00:03:45.901
Take a look at this.

00:03:45.901 --> 00:03:48.000
Ew.
[ Audience groans ]

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:49.367
People are like, "What did you
think we were gonna do?

00:03:49.367 --> 00:03:50.868
Pull over and breathe deeply?
I mean, what do you --"

00:03:50.868 --> 00:03:52.267
[ Laughter ]

00:03:52.267 --> 00:03:53.801
Sadly, now we know what happened

00:03:53.801 --> 00:03:55.300
when the chicken
crossed the road.

00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:58.968
[ Laughter ]

00:03:58.968 --> 00:04:02.000
Guys, I saw that a train in
Argentina had to be delayed

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:04.367
after a man fell asleep
across two seats

00:04:04.367 --> 00:04:06.934
and got his head stuck
under the metal armrest.

00:04:06.934 --> 00:04:08.534
Take a look at this.

00:04:08.534 --> 00:04:10.901
[ Laughter ]

00:04:10.901 --> 00:04:13.834
Laugh all you want, but that's
first class on Spirit Airlines.

00:04:13.834 --> 00:04:16.567
Ah, you know.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:16.567 --> 00:04:18.234
That's the way to go.

00:04:18.234 --> 00:04:21.934
Get your head in there.

00:04:21.934 --> 00:04:24.734
Hey, I heard about a 13-year-old
boy who's about to graduate

00:04:24.734 --> 00:04:26.367
from the University of Minnesota

00:04:26.367 --> 00:04:28.634
with a bachelor's degree
in physics.

00:04:28.634 --> 00:04:30.734
Yeah, you can tell he's super
smart, 'cause he's graduating

00:04:30.734 --> 00:04:32.767
just in time to have
his student loans forgiven.

00:04:32.767 --> 00:04:33.968
Yeah.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:33.968 --> 00:04:39.133
Smart -- Smart kid.

00:04:39.133 --> 00:04:41.300
And, finally, it is time to take
a look at the stories

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:43.901
making headlines today
and weigh the good with the bad.

00:04:43.901 --> 00:04:46.234
It's time for "Pros and Cons."
Here we go.

00:04:46.234 --> 00:04:51.434
-♪ Pros and cons and pros
and cons and pros ♪

00:04:51.434 --> 00:04:53.367
-Tonight, we'll be taking a look
at the pros and cons

00:04:53.367 --> 00:04:56.100
of legalizing weed
in New Jersey.

00:04:56.100 --> 00:05:02.000
That's right.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:04.200
As of last week,
people in New Jersey

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:06.434
can now buy
recreational marijuana,

00:05:06.434 --> 00:05:08.434
so let's take a look
at the pros and cons

00:05:08.434 --> 00:05:11.033
of legalizing weed
in New Jersey.

00:05:11.033 --> 00:05:13.968
Here we go.
Pro -- saying "Fuhgeddaboudit."

00:05:13.968 --> 00:05:15.501
[ Laughter ]

00:05:15.501 --> 00:05:17.667
Con -- then actually
forgetting about it.

00:05:17.667 --> 00:05:19.567
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:19.567 --> 00:05:22.100
"What was I supposed
to remembabout?"

00:05:22.100 --> 00:05:23.634
[ Laughter ]

00:05:23.634 --> 00:05:26.667
Pro -- the marijuana bill
was tough to pass.

00:05:26.667 --> 00:05:29.167
Con -- it was much easier
to puff-puff-pass.

00:05:29.167 --> 00:05:33.267
There you go.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:33.267 --> 00:05:36.634
Pro -- people will quickly go
from this...

00:05:36.634 --> 00:05:38.167
con -- to this...

00:05:38.167 --> 00:05:42.300
There you go.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:46.367
Pro -- a short, tan joint
in New York is called a blunt.

00:05:46.367 --> 00:05:49.100
Con -- a short, tan joint in
New Jersey is called a Snooki.

00:05:49.100 --> 00:05:50.100
Oh, interesting.

00:05:50.100 --> 00:05:51.734
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:51.734 --> 00:05:55.801
[ Rim shot ]

00:05:55.801 --> 00:05:58.834
Pro -- smoking before
catching a long flight.

00:05:58.834 --> 00:06:00.367
Con -- bringing
a whole new meaning to

00:06:00.367 --> 00:06:02.000
"taking the red-eye
out of Newark."

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:07.033
It's like yeah.
[ Applause ]

00:06:07.033 --> 00:06:09.234
Pro --
getting stoned in Bayonne.

00:06:09.234 --> 00:06:11.534
Con -- then playing hacky sack
in Hackensack.

00:06:11.534 --> 00:06:15.667
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:15.667 --> 00:06:17.400
Pro -- people in New Jersey
already know

00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:18.868
how to roll a joint.

00:06:18.868 --> 00:06:21.400
Con -- it's like rolling up
a body in a carpet but smaller.

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:23.300
Hey.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:23.300 --> 00:06:26.801
Whoa.

00:06:26.801 --> 00:06:30.567
Pro -- New Jersey may introduce
many weed-themed businesses.

00:06:30.567 --> 00:06:33.400
Con -- like the new social club
the Bada Bong!

00:06:33.400 --> 00:06:37.000
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:39.901
And finally, pro --
less "Ay! Oh!"

00:06:39.901 --> 00:06:41.901
Con -- more like, "Hey, whoooa!"

00:06:41.901 --> 00:06:43.968
That's the "Pros and Cons,"
everybody.

